   MERRY NJ, 1997, P WA MIN EXPL TECHN.
   PONTUAL S, 1997, GMEX SPECTRAL ANAL G, V1.
   PONTUAL S, 1997, PRACTICAL APPL HDB, V2.},
Number-of-Cited-References = {8},
