   a{*} can better indicate haematite content; Gt/Hm and b{*} /a{*} can
   also better reflect the ratio of goethite to haematite; but Gt and b{*}
   cannot indicate well the content of goethite. Atmospheric hydrothermal
   conditions cannot be completely equal to soil hydrothermal conditions,
