   Cudahy T., 2000, TARGETING VMS STYLE, P395.
   Gupta R.P., 2003, REMOTE SENSING GEOLO.
   McLeod R.L., 1987, Proc. PACRIM Congress, P321.
   Neville RA, 1998, P SOC PHOTO-OPT INS, V3438, P74, DOI 10.1117/12.328124.
