   600-800 nm, the signal is associated with ferrous minerals and at 1400,
   1900, and 2200 nm, to clays minerals as montmorillonite, halloysite, and
   nontronite. The reflectance value is 30 - 50\%. The difference between
   both Phases is in the amplitude and shape of the absorption feature at
